["Each text starts a little left or right at random, so they don't sit on top of each other."] = "每段文字隨機偏左或偏右出現，以免互相重疊。",
["Each trinket slot can swap trinkets by itself (as TrinketMenu's auto queue): put your trinkets in order; when the one you wear goes on cooldown, the first one above the red mark that is ready goes on. A trinket with 30 seconds or less of cooldown counts as ready - putting one on starts a 30 second cooldown anyway. Swaps wait for combat to end. Alt-click a trinket on the trinket bar to switch its slot's queue on or off; a small gear on it shows the queue: gold on, grey holding (Delay), red paused."] = "每個飾品欄位可自動換飾品(類似 TrinketMenu 的自動佇列)：依序排好你的飾品；當你穿的飾品進入冷卻，紅線以上第一個已就緒的飾品會換上。冷卻 30 秒以內的飾品視為就緒 - 反正穿上去就會開始 30 秒冷卻。換裝會等戰鬥結束。在飾品列上 Alt-點擊飾品可開關該欄位的佇列；其上的小齒輪顯示佇列狀態：金色 = 開啟，灰色 = 暫扣(延遲)，紅色 = 暫停。",
