["Every crit entrance explained"] = "說明所有爆擊出場方式",
["Every icon the macro window has, the set's items first. Or click the icon beside the set's name."] = "巨集視窗的所有圖示，套裝的物品排在最前面。或點擊套裝名稱旁的圖示。",
["Every kind of combat text: show it, its colour, where it comes from, always a crit, big, and a sound.\n\nTick to show a message. The swatch is its colour. Where it comes from: a screen area, or the nameplate of the other unit. Crit = always shown as a crit. Big = bigger with a flash so it stands out (Crits sets how much). Sound: picking one plays it.\n\nThe sound lists hold the game's alerts, gunshots and explosions, boss kill lines (\"Die, insect!\"), crowd cheers and victory horns, BigWigs' voices and four files of your own."] = "每種戰鬥文字：是否顯示、顏色、來源、是否一律當爆擊、放大，以及音效。\n\n勾選以顯示該訊息。色塊是它的顏色。來源：螢幕區域，或對方單位的姓名板。爆擊 = 一律以爆擊樣式顯示。大 = 放大並閃光以突顯(幅度在「爆擊」設定)。音效：選取時會播放。\n\n音效清單包含遊戲的警報、槍聲與爆炸、首領擊殺台詞(「去死吧，蟲子!」)、群眾歡呼與勝利號角、BigWigs 的語音，以及四個你自己的檔案。",
["Every kind of plate takes the size of the one you changed last (enemy NPCs if you have not changed one)."] = "每種姓名板都採用你最後更改的那個大小(若尚未更改，則採用敵方 NPC 的)。",
["Every message type back to how it started (formats too)."] = "所有訊息類型回到初始狀態(格式也是)。",
["Every meter window back to its starting place in the middle of the screen."] = "所有統計視窗回到螢幕中央的起始位置。",
["Every movement explained"] = "說明所有移動方式",
["Every movement hits can use, plus staying in place. Point at a name in the list to see what it does."] = "命中可使用的所有移動方式，加上停留原地。指向清單中的名稱即可看到說明。",
["Every nameplate setting - looks, sizes, colours, places, auras, lists - back to how it came (the Plater look). Click twice."] = "所有姓名板設定 - 外觀、大小、顏色、位置、光環、清單 - 回到初始狀態(Plater 外觀)。需點擊兩次。",
["Every other bar that is on gets this bar's button size, spacing and scale, so bars with the same buttons are the same size. Each stays where it is. One bar at a time: Move frames, click a bar, Match size..."] = "其他所有已開啟的動作列都採用此動作列的按鈕大小、間距與縮放，使按鈕相同的動作列大小一致。各自位置不變。一次一列：移動框架、點擊動作列、符合大小…",
["Every part around the map can be dragged to fit any shape."] = "地圖周圍的每個部分都可拖曳，以配合任何形狀。",
["Every part at once. Switching to Blizzard's asks to be kept: not kept within 15 s, it goes back by itself."] = "一次切換所有部分。切換到暴雪版會要求確認保留：15 秒內未確認就會自動還原。",
["Every part back to pfUI Octo's frames."] = "所有部分切回 pfUI Octo 的框架。",
["Every part of the look in your own colours. Parts the look in use does not have are dimmed. Picking another look starts from its own colours again."] = "外觀的每個部分都用你自己的顏色。目前外觀沒有的部分會變暗。選擇另一種外觀會重新使用其自帶顏色。",
["Every part to the game's own frames (kept only when you say so)."] = "所有部分切成遊戲自己的框架(只有你確認才會保留)。",
["Every way to turn them"] = "所有切換方式",
["Every whisper window (conversations are kept)."] = "所有密語視窗(對話會保留)。",
["Everyone nearby (battlegrounds)"] = "附近所有人 (戰場)",
["Everything Blizzard's"] = "全部用暴雪的",
["Everything about a button. Pick a group with the tabs under the sample: its look, hover and press, cooldowns, proc glow or letters. Click a part of the sample button to jump to it; the Test buttons play an effect on the sample or on your own bars."] = "按鈕的一切設定。用範例下方的分頁選擇類別：外觀、懸停與按下、冷卻、觸發光暈或文字。點擊範例按鈕的某部分可跳到對應設定；測試按鈕會在範例或你的動作列上播放特效。",
["Everything on and around the map. Pick a part - here or by clicking it in the preview - then set when it shows, its size and its place. Drag parts in the preview to fit any shape."] = "地圖上及周圍的一切。選擇一個部分 - 在此或直接點擊預覽 - 然後設定何時顯示、大小與位置。在預覽中拖曳各部分以配合任何形狀。",
