["Pick a frame with the tabs: its preview shows at the top. Under it, pick what to change: size and bars, text, buffs, icons, look, the raid layout or what all frames share. Click a part of the preview to jump to its card. The cards named \"All frames\" change every frame."] = "用分頁選擇框架：其預覽顯示在上方。其下選擇要更改的項目：大小與條、文字、增益、圖示、外觀、團隊版面，或所有框架共用的設定。點擊預覽的某部分可跳到其卡片。名為「所有框架」的卡片會更改每個框架。",
["Pick a place below, then how its crits appear and how they move. Point at any name in a list to see what it does."] = "在下方選擇一個位置，然後設定其爆擊的出現與移動方式。指向清單中任何名稱即可看到說明。",
["Pick a place below, then how its crits appear and how they move. Point at any name in a list to see what it does.\n\nEach place - nameplates and the five scroll areas - has its own crit entrance (how a crit appears: slam in, pop, swell...) and its own crit movement (the same as its hits, staying in place, or any of the movements hits can use), and can give crits their own time on screen, travel and direction. The crit look at the bottom (letters, colour, flash, mark) is for every crit. Crit sounds are on Messages and sounds."] = "在下方選擇一個位置，然後設定其爆擊的出現與移動方式。指向清單中任何名稱即可看到說明。\n\n每個位置(姓名板與五個捲動區域)都有自己的爆擊出場方式(爆擊如何出現：猛擊進場、彈出、膨脹…)與爆擊移動方式(與其命中相同、停留原地，或命中可用的任何移動方式)，並可為爆擊設定專屬的顯示時間、移動距離與方向。底部的爆擊外觀(文字、顏色、閃光、標記)適用於所有爆擊。爆擊音效在「訊息與音效」頁。",
["Pick a window with the tabs above the preview (or make a new one), then change it card by card: each card is one part of the window - the picture on its title says which. Every window has its own settings; the preview shows the one you are editing and every change shows at once. Click a part of the preview to jump to its card. Hover any setting for what it does."] = "用預覽上方的分頁選擇視窗(或新建一個)，然後逐張卡片修改：每張卡片是視窗的一個部分 - 標題上的圖示會告訴你是哪部分。每個視窗都有自己的設定；預覽顯示你正在編輯的視窗，每項更改立即可見。點擊預覽的某部分可跳到其卡片。把滑鼠移到任何設定上可看到說明。",
