["Scrolling combat text in five screen areas you place - or rising from nameplates: your damage from the enemy you hit.\n\nEverything SCT and SCT - Damage showed (and Mik's Scrolling Battle Text, NameplateSCT, the game's own options over the years). Test combat text sends sample texts everywhere for a minute; Move frames shows the areas as blue boxes to drag and size.\n\nThe other combat text pages: Scroll areas (where and how text moves), Nameplates (and teammates' damage on them), Crits, Messages and sounds (what shows, its colour, where it comes from), Text and filters, Threat."] = "捲動戰鬥文字顯示在你擺放的五個螢幕區域 - 或從姓名板升起：你對所攻擊敵人造成的傷害。\n\nSCT 與 SCT - Damage 顯示過的一切(以及 Mik's Scrolling Battle Text、NameplateSCT、歷年遊戲自己的選項)。測試戰鬥文字會在各處送出一分鐘的範例文字；移動框架會把這些區域顯示為藍色方塊，可拖曳與調整大小。\n\n其他戰鬥文字頁面：捲動區域(文字在哪裡、如何移動)、姓名板(以及其上的隊友傷害)、爆擊、訊息與音效(顯示什麼、顏色、來源)、文字與過濾、仇恨。",
