["Talk to a Goblin Brainwashing Device and this window takes the place of its menu: each talent slot with its name, picture and talents. Pick a gear set and a UI layout for each; when you switch, the set goes on (armour after combat), the layout changes and the spec's own spells go back on your bars. /gear specs or /specs opens it anywhere to change what goes with each spec."] = "與地精洗腦裝置對話時，此視窗會取代其選單：每個天賦欄位顯示其名稱、圖示與天賦。為每個配置選擇裝備套裝與介面版面；切換時，套裝穿上(護甲在脫戰後)、版面改變，且該配置專屬的法術會放回你的動作列。/gear specs 或 /specs 可在任何地方開啟，以更改每個配置對應的內容。",
