["Text set to \"Nameplate\" rises from the other unit's plate and follows it - and your team's damage can too.\n\nThe damage you deal rises from the enemy you hit (every enemy, not just your target), the damage you take from whoever hit you. Your damage starts that way; any message can (Messages page).\n\nA plate has to be on screen: enemy nameplates on (V), within nameplate range. With no plate the text goes to the fallback area. Works with pfUI's nameplates.\n\nTeammates: the damage your party deals rises from the plate of whoever they hit - smaller, in their class colour, in a column beside your own numbers. Your own damage is never shown twice, and teammates' text never goes to the screen areas."] = "設為「姓名板」的文字會從對方單位的姓名板升起並跟隨它 - 隊友的傷害也可以。\n\n你造成的傷害從你攻擊的敵人身上升起(每個敵人，不只是目標)，你承受的傷害則從攻擊你的單位身上升起。你的傷害預設如此；任何訊息都可以(訊息頁)。\n\n姓名板必須在螢幕上：已開啟敵方姓名板 (V)，且在姓名板範圍內。沒有姓名板時，文字會改到備用區域。適用於 pfUI 的姓名板。\n\n隊友：你的隊伍造成的傷害會從被攻擊者的姓名板升起 - 較小、使用他們的職業顏色、排成一欄在你自己的數字旁。你自己的傷害不會重複顯示，隊友的文字也不會出現在螢幕區域。",
