["The empty part of each row (what is left of the bar)."] = "每列的空白部分(條剩下的部分)。",
["The empty part of the bar."] = "條的空白部分。",
["The empty part of the cast bar (lighter than the health bar's, so a new cast shows)."] = "施法條的空白部分(比生命條的亮，以便看出新的施法)。",
["The fill of the health and cast bars. The Octo ones are pfUI Octo's own art."] = "生命條與施法條的填充。Octo 系列為 pfUI Octo 自製圖樣。",
["The font and outline of every text on plates."] = "姓名板上所有文字的字型與外框。",
["The font of every unit frame; try it on the preview above. A frame can use its own on Text colours and font."] = "所有頭像框架的字型；可在上方預覽試用。框架可在「文字顏色與字型」使用專屬字型。",
["The frame in the colour of its debuff (magic blue, curse purple, poison green, disease brown)."] = "框架以其減益的顏色顯示(魔法藍、詛咒紫、毒綠、疾病棕)。",
["The game's crit: the number pops and moves on."] = "遊戲的爆擊：數字彈出後繼續移動。",
["The game's empty slot"] = "遊戲的空格樣式",
["The game's own frames - player and target, action bars, minimap, buffs, chat and the rest - instead of pfUI Octo's, with everything pfUI Octo adds (meters, combat text, gear sets, specs, nameplate extras...) still on. Blizzard's frames move in Move frames like pfUI's, and each UI layout keeps its own places. Changes at once, no reload; Esc menu > \"pfUI Octo: undo Blizzard\" always goes back."] = "使用遊戲自己的框架 - 玩家與目標、動作列、小地圖、增益、聊天等 - 取代 pfUI Octo 的，但 pfUI Octo 附加的一切(統計、戰鬥文字、裝備套裝、天賦配置、姓名板附加功能…)仍然開啟。暴雪的框架可像 pfUI 的一樣在移動框架中移動，每個介面版面保留各自的位置。立即生效，無需重新載入；Esc 選單 > 「pfUI Octo: undo Blizzard」隨時可還原。",
["The game's own loot window flashes up for each corpse; this closes it. Off: a window that opens is left for you."] = "遊戲自己的拾取視窗會為每具屍體跳出；此項會將其關閉。關閉：開啟的視窗留給你處理。",
["The game's own numbers"] = "遊戲自己的數字",
["The gap between bars."] = "條之間的間距。",
["The guild under a player's name."] = "玩家名字下方的公會。",
["The health bar fills from the bottom up."] = "生命條由下往上填滿。",
["The health just lost stays a moment and fades away."] = "剛損失的生命值會停留片刻後淡出。",
["The icon changes colour when the action cannot be used right now."] = "動作目前無法使用時，圖示會變色。",
["The icons next to the minimap."] = "小地圖旁的圖示。",
["The item's tooltip on the gear buttons, trinket bar and item menus. They never cover an item menu."] = "裝備按鈕、飾品列與物品選單上的物品提示。它們不會遮住物品選單。",
["The key, macro name and count on each button. The cooldown number is under Cooldowns."] = "每個按鈕上的按鍵、巨集名稱與數量。冷卻數字在「冷卻」下。",
