["The label turns yellow at this share of your cap."] = "達到你上限的此比例時，標籤變黃。",
["The last part of a text's time it fades away in."] = "文字在其最後這段時間內淡出。",
["The layout that goes on here."] = "在此啟用的版面。",
["The letters of names and numbers on plates."] = "姓名板上名字與數字的文字。",
["The letters, size, outline and speed of every combat text. Areas can pick their own on Scroll areas."] = "所有戰鬥文字的字型、大小、外框與速度。各區域可在「捲動區域」自行選擇。",
["The line in big letters at the top of the screen for a few seconds."] = "螢幕頂端以大字顯示數秒的一行文字。",
["The look round every button, the icon, and what fills an empty slot. Ready-made looks: General."] = "每個按鈕周圍的外觀、圖示，以及空格的填充。現成外觀：一般。",
["The main chat panel. Move it with Move frames."] = "主聊天面板。可用移動框架移動。",
["The main hand bar changes colour while an attack waits on your next swing."] = "有攻擊等待你下次揮擊時，主手條會變色。",
["The main number on the right."] = "右側的主要數字。",
["The map zooms all the way out after this long (0 = never)."] = "經過此時間後，地圖會縮放到最遠 (0 = 從不)。",
["The map's look: a ready-made style, its shape, border, the spell art around it, size and opacity. Buttons and texts around it are on \"Buttons and text\"."] = "地圖的外觀：現成樣式、形狀、邊框、周圍的法術圖樣、大小與不透明度。周圍的按鈕與文字在「按鈕與文字」。",
["The marker in pfUI Octo's accent colour."] = "標記使用 pfUI Octo 的強調色。",
["The minimap and everything on it (zone name, clock, buttons, the bar under it) hide while you are in these places, and come back when you leave."] = "處於這些地點時，小地圖及其上的一切(區域名稱、時鐘、按鈕、其下的條)會隱藏，離開後恢復。",
["The name on the left and the numbers on the right."] = "名字在左側，數字在右側。",
["The name turns orange while the unit fights."] = "單位戰鬥時名字變橙色。",
["The off hand as a thin bar inside the main hand's."] = "副手以細條顯示在主手條內。",
["The order of total, per second and percent on the right."] = "右側總計、每秒與百分比的順序。",
["The outline takes pfUI Octo's accent colour."] = "外框使用 pfUI Octo 的強調色。",
["The part you picked. Click a part in the preview to pick it there."] = "你選擇的部分。在預覽中點擊某部分也可在那裡選取。",
["The pattern of the bar's fill."] = "條填充的圖案。",
["The per-second and percent figures and their brackets."] = "每秒與百分比數值及其括號。",
["The points pulse when you have all five."] = "集滿五點時連擊點會脈動。",
["The pull point: where the mob turns to you (110% of the tank's threat in melee, 130% at range). The top player: stay behind the tank; the top two or three: behind the off-tank or a big hitter too."] = "拉走點：怪物轉向你的臨界點(近戰為坦克仇恨的 110%，遠程為 130%)。最高玩家：保持在坦克之後；前二或前三：也要在副坦或高輸出者之後。",
["The same as clicking the meters button on your screen."] = "與點擊螢幕上的統計按鈕相同。",
["The same as the arrow at the right end of the bottom-right bar."] = "與右下動作列右端的箭頭相同。",
["The same attack on the same enemy within the merge window (Text and filters) adds to the number already there: \"1840 x3\" instead of three lines."] = "在合併時間窗口內(文字與過濾)，對同一敵人的相同攻擊會累加到已有的數字：顯示「1840 x3」而非三行。",
["The same flash crits get."] = "與爆擊相同的閃光。",
["The same for mana after the five-second rule."] = "法力在五秒規則後同樣適用。",
["The same looks for every bar."] = "所有動作列使用相同外觀。",
