["The shot's name and the time left."] = "射擊的名稱與剩餘時間。",
["The size of your own arrow on the map."] = "你在地圖上的箭頭大小。",
["The small arrow at the right end of the bottom-right bar (time and fps), as pfUI always had it: a click opens or shuts the window above it. Loot & Spam: the window opens with Loot & Spam in it, and on shutting Loot & Spam goes back to a tab in the left chat. Meters: the window opens with your meter windows docked in it, side by side. In Move frames, right-click that bar to come here."] = "右下動作列右端的小箭頭(時間與 FPS)，與 pfUI 一直以來相同：點擊可開關其上方的視窗。拾取與洗頻：視窗開啟時裡面是拾取與洗頻，關閉後拾取與洗頻會回到左側聊天的分頁。統計：視窗開啟時裡面並排停靠你的統計視窗。在移動框架中，右鍵點擊該動作列即可來到此處。",
