["Wear a set while something is happening - riding, swimming, in a stance or form, in a city, a battleground or a raid - and put back what you wore when it ends. The first one in the list that is happening wins. Armour waits for combat to end (weapons swap at once); everything waits while you are dead or casting."] = "在某事發生時穿上一套裝備 - 騎乘、游泳、處於姿態或形態、在城市、戰場或團隊副本 - 結束後換回原本的裝備。清單中第一個正在發生的事件優先。護甲會等戰鬥結束(武器立即更換)；死亡或施法期間一切都會等待。",
["Web links"] = "網頁連結",
["WeirdUtils"] = "WeirdUtils",
["WeirdUtils is a client DLL (codeberg.org/MarcelineVQ/WeirdUtils) with world markers, minimap tracking, a big cursor, PNG screenshots, per-day logs and several fixes. This page controls all of it."] = "WeirdUtils 是一個客戶端 DLL (codeberg.org/MarcelineVQ/WeirdUtils)，提供世界標記、小地圖追蹤、大型游標、PNG 截圖、每日記錄與多項修正。此頁面控制其所有功能。",
["WeirdUtils is not running in this game."] = "此遊戲中未執行 WeirdUtils。",
["What \"its own colours\" means for this frame, and its font."] = "「專屬顏色」對此框架的含意，以及其字型。",
