["What a new whisper does while you fight."] = "戰鬥中收到新密語時的行為。",
["What a unit is casting, under its plate. When a cast ends it flashes green (done) or red (stopped), with who interrupted it when the combat log says."] = "單位正在施放什麼，顯示在其姓名板下方。施法結束時閃綠色(完成)或紅色(被中斷)，戰鬥記錄有提供時還會顯示是誰打斷的。",
["What each movement in the lists does (the same for hits, crits, areas and nameplates)."] = "清單中每種移動方式的作用(命中、爆擊、區域與姓名板皆相同)。",
["What else the Normal layout changes."] = "一般版面還會更改什麼。",
["What else the PvP layout changes."] = "PvP 版面還會更改什麼。",
["What else the Raid layout changes."] = "團隊版面還會更改什麼。",
["What every text says, what is left out, which buffs are procs, and each message's wording."] = "每段文字的內容、省略什麼、哪些增益算觸發，以及每則訊息的措辭。",
["What every text says, what is left out, which buffs are procs, and each message's wording.\n\nFormats: %a amount, %s spell, buff, item or other thing, %n the other unit's name, %t the kind (Dodge, Fire, Rage, Falling...). Spell names and names are added by themselves when the format leaves them out and their boxes under What the texts say are ticked. Press Enter to save; empty = the original.\n\nLists: names separated by commas, as the game spells them. Press Enter to save."] = "每段文字的內容、省略什麼、哪些增益算觸發，以及每則訊息的措辭。\n\n格式：%a 數量，%s 法術、增益、物品或其他事物，%n 對方單位的名字，%t 類型(閃躲、火焰、怒氣、摔落…)。當格式未包含法術名稱與名字，且「文字內容」下對應的方塊已勾選時，會自動補上。按 Enter 儲存；留空 = 原文。\n\n清單：名字以逗號分隔，須與遊戲拼寫一致。按 Enter 儲存。",
