["|cff73bfffDirection|r\n|cffffd100Up|r  Texts travel upwards.\n|cffffd100Down|r  Texts travel downwards.\n|cffffd100Up and down, taking turns|r  Each new text goes the other way, starting from the middle.\n\n|cff73bfffSide|r\n|cffffd100Alternate left and right|r  Each new text goes to the other side.\n|cffffd100Left|r  Every text goes left.\n|cffffd100Right|r  Every text goes right.\n|cffffd100Random side|r  Left or right, picked at random each time.\n|cffffd100Damage left, heals right|r  Damage goes left, heals go right.\n|cffffd100Damage right, heals left|r  Damage goes right, heals go left.\n\n|cff73bfffStraight or diagonal|r (movements that rise or fall)\n|cffffd100Straight|r  Straight up or down.\n|cffffd100Diagonal left|r  Slants to the left as it travels.\n|cffffd100Diagonal right|r  Slants to the right as it travels.\n|cffffd100Diagonal to the side|r  Slants to the side picked under Side (alternate, random, damage left...).\n\n|cff73bfffHeight as it goes|r (movements that go sideways)\n|cffffd100At a random height|r  Each text starts a little higher or lower at random.\n|cffffd100Level|r  Straight across, all at the same height.\n|cffffd100Rising (diagonal up)|r  Climbs as it goes sideways.\n|cffffd100Falling (diagonal down)|r  Drops as it goes sideways.\n\n|cff73bfffAngle|r  How steep a diagonal is: 15, 30, 45 or 60 degrees."] = "|cff73bfff方向|r\n|cffffd100向上|r  文字向上移動。\n|cffffd100向下|r  文字向下移動。\n|cffffd100上下交替|r  每段新文字朝相反方向移動，從中間開始。\n\n|cff73bfff側向|r\n|cffffd100左右交替|r  每段新文字移到另一側。\n|cffffd100左|r  所有文字向左。\n|cffffd100右|r  所有文字向右。\n|cffffd100隨機側向|r  每次隨機向左或向右。\n|cffffd100傷害向左，治療向右|r  傷害向左，治療向右。\n|cffffd100傷害向右，治療向左|r  傷害向右，治療向左。\n\n|cff73bfff直線或斜線|r (上升或下降的移動方式)\n|cffffd100直線|r  垂直向上或向下。\n|cffffd100向左斜|r  行進時向左傾斜。\n|cffffd100向右斜|r  行進時向右傾斜。\n|cffffd100向側面斜|r  向「側向」所選的一側傾斜(交替、隨機、傷害向左…)。\n\n|cff73bfff行進時的高度|r (橫向移動的方式)\n|cffffd100隨機高度|r  每段文字隨機從稍高或稍低處開始。\n|cffffd100水平|r  橫向直線移動，高度相同。\n|cffffd100上升 (斜向上)|r  橫向移動時向上爬升。\n|cffffd100下降 (斜向下)|r  橫向移動時向下掉落。\n\n|cff73bfff角度|r  斜線的陡度：15、30、45 或 60 度。",
["|cffe53f3fPvP|r"] = "|cffe53f3fPvP|r",
["|cffff5555-- stop the queue here --|r"] = "|cffff5555-- 佇列到此為止 --|r",
["|cffff8c26Raid|r"] = "|cffff8c26團隊|r",
["|cffffd100Pop (SCT Sticky)|r  Pops a little bigger for a moment as it appears.\n|cffffd100Slam in (MSBT Pow)|r  Starts twice as big and slams down to size.\n|cffffd100Slam and shake|r  Slams in like Pow, then shakes for half a second.\n|cffffd100Shrink in from big (SCT Flash)|r  Starts twice as big and shrinks to size over a third of a second.\n|cffffd100Swell and settle (Blizzard)|r  The game's own crit: swells fast, then settles a little bigger than a hit.\n|cffffd100Grow from small (Zoom)|r  Starts small and grows to size, with a little overshoot.\n|cffffd100None, just bigger|r  No entrance: the crit is simply bigger than a hit.\n"] = "|cffffd100彈出 (SCT 黏著)|r  出現時短暫放大一點。\n|cffffd100猛擊進場 (MSBT Pow)|r  以兩倍大小開始，猛然縮到正常大小。\n|cffffd100猛擊並震動|r  像 Pow 一樣猛擊進場，然後震動半秒。\n|cffffd100由大縮小 (SCT 閃爍)|r  以兩倍大小開始，在三分之一秒內縮到正常大小。\n|cffffd100膨脹後回穩 (暴雪)|r  遊戲自己的爆擊：快速膨脹，然後穩定在比命中稍大的尺寸。\n|cffffd100由小放大 (縮放)|r  從小開始放大到正常大小，略有超出。\n|cffffd100無，僅放大|r  沒有進場效果：爆擊只是比命中大。\n",
["|cffffd100Vertical (SCT)|r  Straight up (or down) the area, one line after another.\n|cffffd100Rainbow arc (SCT)|r  Arcs out to the side and drops, like a rainbow.\n|cffffd100Horizontal (SCT)|r  Slides out sideways at a random height.\n|cffffd100Angled down (SCT)|r  Shoots out and down, shakes, holds, then drifts away.\n|cffffd100Angled up (SCT)|r  Shoots out and up, shakes, holds, then drifts up.\n|cffffd100Sprinkler (SCT)|r  Each new text leaves at the next angle of a fan.\n|cffffd100HUD curved (SCT)|r  Runs up the side of a circle round the middle of the screen.\n|cffffd100HUD angled (SCT)|r  Runs up a slanted line beside the middle of the screen.\n|cffffd100Parabola (MSBT)|r  Rises and bulges out half way up, MSBT style.\n|cffffd100Static (MSBT / messages)|r  Stays put; new lines push the older ones along. Good for messages.\n|cffffd100Fountain (NameplateSCT)|r  Flies up out to the side and falls, like a fountain.\n|cffffd100Rainfall (NameplateSCT)|r  Falls down from a random spot.\n|cffffd100Fireworks (NameplateSCT)|r  Bursts out in a random direction.\n|cffffd100Sway|r  Rises with a slow sway from side to side.\n|cffffd100Wave|r  Rises in a quicker wave.\n|cffffd100Zigzag|r  Rises zigzagging left and right.\n|cffffd100Spiral|r  Rises turning in a spiral.\n|cffffd100Bounce|r  Bounces up and out to the side.\n|cffffd100Shockwave|r  Blasts out to the side fast, then slows.\n|cffffd100Comet|r  Streaks out to the side in a curve.\n|cffffd100Random mix|r  A different movement each time, picked at random.\n"] = "|cffffd100垂直 (SCT)|r  沿區域垂直向上(或向下)，一行接一行。\n|cffffd100彩虹弧 (SCT)|r  向側面弧形飛出並落下，如同彩虹。\n|cffffd100水平 (SCT)|r  在隨機高度向側面滑出。\n|cffffd100斜向下 (SCT)|r  向外並向下射出，震動、停住，然後飄走。\n|cffffd100斜向上 (SCT)|r  向外並向上射出，震動、停住，然後向上飄走。\n|cffffd100灑水器 (SCT)|r  每段新文字依扇形的下一個角度射出。\n|cffffd100HUD 弧形 (SCT)|r  沿著螢幕中央周圍的圓弧側邊向上。\n|cffffd100HUD 斜向 (SCT)|r  沿著螢幕中央旁的斜線向上。\n|cffffd100拋物線 (MSBT)|r  上升並在中途向外鼓出，MSBT 風格。\n|cffffd100靜態 (MSBT / 訊息)|r  停在原位；新行會把舊行推開。適合訊息。\n|cffffd100噴泉 (NameplateSCT)|r  向上飛向側面然後落下，像噴泉。\n|cffffd100降雨 (NameplateSCT)|r  從隨機位置落下。\n|cffffd100煙火 (NameplateSCT)|r  朝隨機方向迸發。\n|cffffd100搖擺|r  緩慢左右搖擺地上升。\n|cffffd100波浪|r  以較快的波浪上升。\n|cffffd100鋸齒|r  左右鋸齒狀上升。\n|cffffd100螺旋|r  螺旋轉動上升。\n|cffffd100彈跳|r  向上並向側面彈跳。\n|cffffd100震波|r  快速向側面轟出，然後減速。\n|cffffd100彗星|r  以曲線向側面劃出。\n|cffffd100隨機混合|r  每次隨機使用不同的移動方式。\n",
["|cffffffff8 columns x 5 rows|r of 48 x 24 px frames - the whole raid 410 x 152 px"] = "|cffffffff8 欄 x 5 列|r，每個框架 48 x 24 像素 - 整個團隊 410 x 152 像素",
}
